WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.190
The black box isn't black.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.647
It's bright orange, and it usually sits

00:00:04.657 --> 00:00:06.622
in the tail, where it's most likely

00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:07.693
to survive.

00:00:07.703 --> 00:00:10.864
An Australian scientist,
David Warren, came up

00:00:10.874 --> 00:00:11.627
with it.

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:13.255
He'd seen a tiny recorder at a

00:00:13.265 --> 00:00:14.730
fair, and thought:

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.280
record the cockpit.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.280
But which crash mystery was he working

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:18.941
on?

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:19.903
The Comet's.

00:00:19.913 --> 00:00:22.791
The first commercial
jetliner kept crashing, and

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:25.013
at first nobody knew why.
